    "detailed_description": "Pogoman is a 3D adrenaline-fueled, physics-based platformer that offers high difficulty and interesting game mechanics.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Main game features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>35 carefully designed levels with different themes.<br></li><li>Unique game mechanics in each level.<br></li><li>Over 50 gadgets to customize your character.<br></li><li>Control with a mouse (or analog stick for gamepad) with an emphasis on balancing.<br></li><li>Gamepad support (DS4/DualSense and Xbox One controller).<br></li><li>Highly challenging platformer with a focus on precision and occasional speed.<br></li><li>Completing levels and collecting stars to unlock gadgets.<br></li><li>Ability to customize the appearance of the character and the colors of the pogo stick.<br></li><li>Leaderboards to compare best times with friends.</li></ul><br>Pogoman is designed for gamers who enjoy challenging physics-based platformers and precise gameplay. Get ready for the challenges that await you in each level and try to achieve the best completion times.",
    "about_the_game": "Pogoman is a 3D adrenaline-fueled, physics-based platformer that offers high difficulty and interesting game mechanics.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Main game features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>35 carefully designed levels with different themes.<br></li><li>Unique game mechanics in each level.<br></li><li>Over 50 gadgets to customize your character.<br></li><li>Control with a mouse (or analog stick for gamepad) with an emphasis on balancing.<br></li><li>Gamepad support (DS4/DualSense and Xbox One controller).<br></li><li>Highly challenging platformer with a focus on precision and occasional speed.<br></li><li>Completing levels and collecting stars to unlock gadgets.<br></li><li>Ability to customize the appearance of the character and the colors of the pogo stick.<br></li><li>Leaderboards to compare best times with friends.</li></ul><br>Pogoman is designed for gamers who enjoy challenging physics-based platformers and precise gameplay. Get ready for the challenges that await you in each level and try to achieve the best completion times.",
    "short_description": "Challenge yourself with demanding jumps across all levels, unlock every gadget, and be particularly careful not to break anything in your surroundings.",
